.update_helicopter
    LDA level
    CMP #&04
    BCS is_present_1825             \ No helicopter on first set of levels
    RTS
.is_present_1825
    LDA helicopter_x
    STA screen_x
    LDA helicopter_y
    STA screen_y
    JSR calculate_screen_address
    LDA screen_address_low
